# Audit ledger — Phase <N>

Finding ledger for this phase. One section per finding —
findings include bugs, regressions, contract violations,
performance regressions, security issues, capability gaps. The
per-section `Status:` field drifts; the **Resolution log** at
the bottom is canonical.

## Status legend

- `[ ]` open — not started.
- `[x]` closed — fix landed (commit hash + finding-id reference).
- `[~]` partial — partially landed, awaiting verify.
- `[?]` investigating — symptom seen, root cause unclear.

## Severity scale

- **P1** — blocks the release. User-visible breakage, data loss, regression on a contracted invariant, security incident.
- **P2** — blocks the phase. Test or build red, behaviour wrong but not yet user-facing.
- **P3** — polish. Visible drift, minor a11y, naming, log noise.
- **P4** — nice-to-have. Defer freely.

